# Navigator authoritative-frame gesture fix

## Pre-work plan

- Background: Daedalus formal 18884 consumer found fixed-edge drift when an authoritative frame arrived during an active gesture.
- Goal: preserve active preview geometry and semantic ownership across shell replacement without changing public wire types or Research host code.
- Scope: Renderer state/selection binding, owner unit/browser fixtures, RFC/WBS/Test/DevLog, Renderer and Client package metadata.
- Acceptance: exact-package Expecto 68/68; focused real-browser regression injects a changed projection during left/right/body/boundary gestures and passes 1/1; source committed before immutable publish; Daedalus reruns 18884 afterward.
